@startuml Sequence Diagram - Webhook Notification
title Escenario 4 - Notificacion Webhook (Simulator API)
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #666666
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #666666

participant "Tester / QA\n(o Trigger Interno)" as Tester
participant "Simulator API\n(Fastify)" as SimAPI
participant "SignatureGenerator" as Generator
participant "WebhookDispatcher" as Dispatcher
participant "Comercio\n(Webhook Endpoint)" as Comercio
participant "SDK KitPagos" as SDK

Tester -> SimAPI : POST /v1/sim/webhooks/trigger\n{gateway, transactionId}
SimAPI -> Generator : generate(subject)
Generator --> SimAPI : OutgoingWebhook
SimAPI -> Dispatcher : deliver(webhook)
Dispatcher -> Comercio : POST {webhookUrl}(rawPayload, headers)

Comercio -> SDK : validateWebhook(rawPayload, headers, options?)

alt firma valida
  SDK --> Comercio : WebhookEvent
  opt Webhook liviano (Mercado Pago: solo ID)
    Comercio -> SDK : getPaymentStatus(gatewayTransactionId)
    SDK --> Comercio : Transaction (estado consolidado)
  end
  Comercio -> Comercio : actualizar orden interna
else firma invalida
  SDK -->x Comercio : throw KitPagosError(WEBHOOK_SIGNATURE_INVALID)
  Comercio -->x Comercio : descartar evento
end

note over Dispatcher, SDK
  Wompi: header X-Event-Checksum + body signature.checksum (SHA-256)
  Rapyd: header signature (Base64 HMAC-SHA256 sobre
  url_path+salt+timestamp+access_key+secret_key+body);
  salt/timestamp/access_key en headers separados
  Mercado Pago: header x-signature ts=...,v1=... (HMAC-SHA256)
  Kushki: mecanismo de firma no documentado en fuentes
  oficiales; SDK y simulador informan esta limitacion.
end note

@enduml
